{"title":"2019 Mock AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_Mock_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2ddeba58475498c328fa8ba2d30fa2aa70963d39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\{r_1, r_2, r_3, ..., r_{\\mu}\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"165\" height=\"19\" /> be the set of all possible remainders when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/f/f9fd0c889193a1d5b642b5c1e5c67c18f37ab73b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15^{n} - 7^{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/d/abd678361b0f40ec2723283c0f2bab3df5cadc68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive integer and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/8/2d8c833ed800824727cd7bd2fb9de1a12ad7e674.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mu$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" /> is the number of elements in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />. The sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/1953ea0858ee3cd60b50780cd87b15fb1c939451.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1 + r_2 + r_3 + ... + r_{\\mu}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"167\" height=\"15\" /> can be expressed as<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ef78a97f88f2c6b8fe060205ea30c4927b9520.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[p^qr,\\]\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" />where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/6/48689d638ddca59030006d362cbd848607f63aa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p, q, r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"11\" /> are positive integers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are as small as possible. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/8/d08ff3681d6992f69ee41e21c7237c89f970ac49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q+r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/a/7aa690e365914122ded40732f47c20e62464bb8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 40\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 41\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 42\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 43\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_Mock_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/b/0db6497f6a1fb04b5408517b94c9333072992036.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15^n - 7^n \\equiv 7^n - 7^n \\equiv 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"183\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/1/091b409f65d6c59d68a9214102d17737c92b574a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{mod}$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for all integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3d1431ad346632b25a0e7b3f12ebe19723b3960.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/1/511f6e2661b1b0f417b26ac214995f3f9f91eaba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\{0, 8, 16, 24,...,248\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />. Since the sum of all elements in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/4/0d4cee63eaebd60c5ae8e7c48f5a269bf6746333.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 + 16 + 24 + ... + 248 = 8(1 + 2 + 3 + ... + 31) = 8 \\cdot \\frac{31(31 + 1)}{2} = 2^7 \\cdot 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"577\" height=\"38\" />, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/7/5172176890599a44e52a23ac1714a4bf36c30176.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 7 + 31 = \\boxed{\\text{(A)} 40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"160\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018011318\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 94/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3952/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17802:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018011318 and revision id 110857. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}